{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40716","headline":"赋得送轩辕先生归罗浮山 · 李洞","name":"赋得送轩辕先生归罗浮山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧山归隐浪摇青，绿鬓山童一帙经。\n诗帖布帆猿鸟看，药煎金鼎鬼神听。\n洞深头上聆仙语，船静鼻中闻海腥。\n此处先生应不住，吾君南望漫劳形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}